# MEA Tasks Site — MarketLink

## Stack
- **Framework**: Laravel 12, PHP 8.2+
- **Frontend**: Blade templates, Tailwind CSS, Alpine.js
- **Database**: MySQL
- **Runtime**: Docker Compose
- **File Storage**: Local disk + NAS (AcademyNasStorage service)

## Project Structure
- `app/Http/Controllers/` — Web admin controllers
- `app/Http/Controllers/Employee/` — Employee-facing controllers
- `app/Models/` — Eloquent models
- `app/Services/` — Business logic services (NAS storage, file movers, etc.)
- `app/Support/WorkHub.php` — Helper for detecting current actor (User or Employee)
- `resources/views/` — Blade views
- `resources/views/layouts/` — Layout files: `dashboard.blade.php` (admin), `employee.blade.php`, `admin.blade.php`
- `routes/web.php` — All routes

## Auth & Guards
- **web** guard → `User` model (admins)
- **employee** guard → `Employee` model
- `WorkHub::actor($request)` returns the current actor (User or Employee) based on route/guard

## Key Models
- `WorkActivity` — A work project/activity containing tasks
- `WorkTask` — Individual tasks within an activity (has pipeline stages)
- `WorkTaskFile` — Files attached to tasks
- `WorkIdea` — Suggested ideas (inbox separate from workspace)
- `Employee` — Employee users with roles (designer, video_editor, etc.)

## Conventions
- UI language is **Arabic (RTL)**
- Use `work_route()` helper for generating work routes
- Views use `@extends` with dynamic layout variable (e.g. `$ideasLayout`)
- NAS operations go through `AcademyNasStorage` service
- Employee routes are prefixed with `employee/` and use `employee.*` route names

## Deployment
- See `.cursor/vps-deployment.md` for full deployment instructions
- Quick deploy: `ssh test@192.168.68.223 "cd /home/test/marketlink-web && bash deploy.sh"`
- After deploy, fix permissions if 500 error: `chown -R www-data:www-data storage bootstrap/cache`
